 * cost hint for wrapper functions
 *
 * Revision 1.34  2008/05/20 07:25:04  ruslan
 * using multidirectional
 *
 * Revision 1.33  2008/05/19 15:02:02  ruslan
 * removing type check affects costs
 *
 * Revision 1.32  2008/05/15 15:27:19  ruslan
 * multidirection particle-event relationship. interface of root_scan_project_addslots is improved
 *
 * Revision 1.31  2008/05/12 15:42:36  ruslan
 * cost model of closednf is improved
 *
 * Revision 1.30  2008/05/10 13:17:16  ruslan
 * wrapper returns only sobject without the key vector, names of wrapper functions in correspondance with the Thesis, aleh_stream is used to stream events instead of filename
 *
 * Revision 1.29  2008/05/09 06:52:28  ruslan
 * more unnecessary attributes are projected away
 *
 * Revision 1.28  2008/05/06 12:26:14  ruslan
 * files should be given
 *
 * Revision 1.27  2008/05/06 08:21:09  ruslan
 * new definition of the view
 *
