 * corresponds to the new view definition
 *
 * Revision 1.25  2008/04/10 12:55:42  ruslan
 * test of interval execution
 *
 * Revision 1.24  2008/03/14 13:56:57  ruslan
 * cost for operators is 1 by default
 *
 * Revision 1.23  2008/03/10 15:59:03  ruslan
 * type containers defined. this removes some type check, but not all of them, while they still can be removed somehow. missing cost models
 *
 * Revision 1.22  2008/03/06 15:40:00  ruslan
 * cost model for vector is done in more natural way. only fanout is passed from get_slot to vrefbff
