 * using sobjects
 *
 * Revision 1.18  2008/02/18 14:32:04  ruslan
 * tuples in misseecuts
 *
 * Revision 1.17  2008/02/17 08:58:14  ruslan
 * using not in over tuple instead of multiple !=
